  "description": "Community (free) edition of sgcEditors .NET: all nine input controls (month calendar, date, time and date time pickers, range slider, rating, spin edit, colour picker and token edit) in WinForms, WPF and Avalonia, with themes, keyboard, DPI and headless PNG and SVG output. Free for both commercial and non-commercial use by small teams (individuals and organizations under EUR 1M annual gross revenue and no more than 5 developers); organizations at or above either threshold need a Commercial licence. The HSV and alpha parts of the colour picker, the token auto-complete list and the two thumb range slider are not included in the Community edition. https://www.esegece.com",
